cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template (or a challenge built from it) in your work, please cite it."
title: "blind-challenge-template: infrastructure for running a blind ML challenge"
abstract: >-
  A reusable template for standing up a blind machine-learning challenge:
  a bootstrapped scoring backend for regression, classification, and
  protein-ligand structure prediction, OpenTofu-managed AWS infrastructure,
  and a Hugging Face Spaces frontend for submissions and leaderboards.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenADMET"
  - name: "Open Molecular Software Foundation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OpenADMET/blind-challenge-template"
url: "https://github.com/OpenADMET/blind-challenge-template"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - blind challenge
  - benchmarking
  - machine learning
  - cheminformatics
  - ADMET
  - leaderboard